Key takeaway: GitHub stores and publishes your Helm charts, GitHub Pages serves the Helm repository, and your Kubernetes machine uses Helm to retrieve and install those charts.

You can keep this document as your Helm repository runbook and reuse the command reference whenever you publish new charts.
